---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (Shared across all sale contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator invokes emergencyWithdraw(token, amount)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_paused: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_paused --> q_transfer: contract is paused or emergency conditions met
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_state: no emergency condition
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert NoEmergency
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(legionTreasury, amount); emit EmergencyWithdrawal(token, amount)

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Emergency withdraw is a privileged operation for Legion operators only
        INV-002: Used for fund recovery in security incidents
        INV-003: Transfers to Legion treasury, not arbitrary addresses
    end note
